msgstr "Bouton arrière GL (Pro Controller 2)"

msgctxt "#30424"
msgid "GR back button (Pro Controller 2)"
msgstr "Bouton arrière GR (Pro Controller 2)"

msgctxt "#30425"
msgid "What the button does in Kodi – in addition to its normal function in games."
msgstr "Ce que fait le bouton dans Kodi, en plus de sa fonction normale dans les jeux."

